          {
            "name": "",
            "rating": 5,
            "text": "What I can say differently than: I was feeling at home, with all the attention of Madame Bernadette!\nI made this chiose for my stay near Lille (business trip) and I will do again and again.\nRecomanded breakfast,!",
            "language_code": "",
            "publish_time": "2024-12-18T23:12:52+00:00",
            "relative_publish_time": "il y a un an",
            "author": {
